      "updated": 1761490000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "CHOOSE BY ACCESS PATTERN\n• Relational: joins, constraints, multi-row transactions.\n• Document: nested, document-shaped access patterns.\n• Redis: low-latency cache, TTL, counters, ephemeral state.\n• Search index / analytics store: derived views, often eventually consistent.\n• OLTP = application transactions; OLAP = analytics and large aggregations.\nRULE: identify the source of truth; treat caches and indexes as derived unless designed otherwise.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CHOOSE BY ACCESS PATTERN\n• Relational: joins, constraints, multi-row transactions.\n• Document: nested, document-shaped access patterns.\n• Redis: low-latency cache, TTL, counters, ephemeral state.\n• Search index / analytics store: derived views, often eventually consistent.\n• OLTP = application transactions; OLAP = analytics and large aggregations.\nRULE: identify the source of truth; treat caches and indexes as derived unless designed otherwise.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
