      "seed": 1122,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1914,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761490000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "INDEXING TRADE-OFF\n• Faster supported reads; extra storage and write maintenance.\n• Compound index order matters: leftmost-prefix behavior.\n• Starting heuristic: Equality → Sort → Range (validate the real plan).\n• Use explain/executionStats: keys examined, docs examined, returned rows.\n• An index is not automatically useful if a query scans most records or sorts expensively.\nEXAMPLE: { tenantId: 1, status: 1, createdAt: -1 }",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "INDEXING TRADE-OFF\n• Faster supported reads; extra storage and write maintenance.\n• Compound index order matters: leftmost-prefix behavior.\n• Starting heuristic: Equality → Sort → Range (validate the real plan).\n• Use explain/executionStats: keys examined, docs examined, returned rows.\n• An index is not automatically useful if a query scans most records or sorts expensively.\nEXAMPLE: { tenantId: 1, status: 1, createdAt: -1 }",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
