      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "SHARD KEY CHECKLIST\n• High cardinality and balanced traffic/data.\n• Fits common query filters for targeted routing.\n• Avoid monotonic write hotspots and tenant skew.\n• Range sharding helps ranges but can hotspot; hash sharding distributes more evenly but may scatter range queries.\n• Sharding adds rebalancing, backup, and multi-shard query complexity.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SHARD KEY CHECKLIST\n• High cardinality and balanced traffic/data.\n• Fits common query filters for targeted routing.\n• Avoid monotonic write hotspots and tenant skew.\n• Range sharding helps ranges but can hotspot; hash sharding distributes more evenly but may scatter range queries.\n• Sharding adds rebalancing, backup, and multi-shard query complexity.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
